    mistakes: ["Calling remove(x) for a value that is absent and crashing with ValueError — test membership ('x' in list) first when unsure.", "Expecting a slice to be a live view: editing ips[:2] never changes ips — slices are copies.", "Sorting IP strings alphabetically and trusting the order — '10.0.0.5' < '203...' as TEXT, but ranges are numeric; sort by a numeric key."],
