      "Dictionaries nest: users['rahim']['locked'] walks record → field. Real data (JSON, scan output, API responses) is dicts inside lists inside dicts. The discipline is to walk one level at a time and use .get() at any level where real-world data might omit a field — messy data is the normal case, not the exception.",
