    android: ["Android: phone interpreters manage their own packages inside the app; the venv discipline applies to your PC and future servers, not the phone sandbox."],
    lab: "Guided lab: write the exact four commands (for YOUR operating system) to set up a fresh project named logtool with requests installed and frozen — from memory, then check against this lesson.",
